   other dependency installed into node_modules.

   "Participant Work" means material you create yourself while doing the
   homework, such as your own World definition, your answers in the assignment
   files, your scenarios and your evidence.

   "Permitted Purpose" means (a) participating in the Agentic World Bootcamp,
   and (b) completing, submitting and personally studying your own educational
